repository-code: "https://github.com/USERNAME/REPOSITORY"
abstract: >
  This reproducibility package contains exported WordProc SOI datasets,
  consensus subsets, analysis scripts, and generated outputs used to reproduce
  the descriptive SOI characterization reported in the manuscript
  "From Pareto Fronts to Decision Spaces: A Method-Agnostic Workflow for
  Post-Optimization Decision Support in the Next Release Problem".
keywords:
  - "Next Release Problem"
  - "visual analytics"
  - "post-optimization decision support"
  - "Pareto front"
  - "Solutions of Interest"
  - "reproducibility"
